From: hyperminer <admin@blazecoin.co.uk>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 21:38:40 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] pqsig: activate by height
 (Consensus::Params::PQSigHeight, regtest 1500; unscheduled on mainnet and
 testnet) instead of version bits, which cannot signal on Dogecoin (the miner
 pins base version 4 and the AuxPoW header uses those bits for the chain id);
 getblockchaininfo reports it under softforks; regtest functional test
 pqsig-softfork.py: a bad-signature spend is accepted in a block before the
 height and rejected after it, the honest spend relays and mines, mutations
 and the scriptSig policy are refused with their own errors

---
